------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The tetriz-py image installs the third-party Python packages that uv.lock pins
for the service's runtime, each under its own licence. THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
lists every one with its version and SPDX licence, and each installed package
carries its own licence text in its .dist-info directory inside the image's
/app/.venv. The image's base layer (python:3.11-slim) carries the licences of
CPython and the Debian packages it contains under /usr/share/doc.

No third-party source is vendored in this directory.
